# The build context must never carry real data or secrets into an image.
# spike/ holds real order history, vendor sessions and logged-in browser
# profiles; .env holds the database password and the Cognito client secret.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
spike/
docs/
.git/
.bolt/
.claude/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.chromedata/
**/.userdata/
**/*.log
